{"id": "68914", "title": "迟爱", "author": "苏苏小绮", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 7, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/68/68914.htm", "intro": "顾菲16岁那年遇见了唐家二少\r\n\r\n他为她戒去风流，从此对她百般宠爱\r\n\r\n她跟在他身边做无忧小姑娘\r\n\r\n可，数年甜蜜爱恋\r\n\r\n最终却换得他毫无预兆的一场背叛\r\n\r\n赫然中断的浓情爱意\r\n\r\n三年之后的不期而遇\r\n\r\n从植入骨髓的亲密\r\n\r\n到两两相忘的冷漠\r\n\r\n深情难赋何去何从\r\n\r\n\r\n内容标签：破镜重圆 虐恋情深 情有独钟 豪门高干", "base": "files/article/html/68/68914", "chapters": [{"title": "1-2", "file": "10551214.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3-5", "file": "10551215.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "10551216.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-14", "file": "10551217.html", "available": false}, {"title": "15-17", "file": "10551218.html", "available": false}, {"title": "18-20", "file": "10551219.html", "available": false}, {"title": "完结", "file": "10551220.html", "available": false}]}